<Layout
  title="Are Violin Lessons Worth It If You Play for Yourself? | Vibrations Violin Studio"
  description="You don't need professional ambitions for violin lessons to be worthwhile. Learn how practice, curiosity, good teaching, and steady progress make adult violin study rewarding."
  ogImage="/images/insights/is-it-worth-taking-violin-lessons-just-to-play-for-yourself.jpg"
>

  <!-- ── Hero banner ── -->
  <section
    class="hero-interior"
