      { "question": "Are violin lessons worth it if I only want to play for fun?", "answer": "Yes, they can be. Lessons give you feedback, a clear sequence of skills, and help choosing what to work on next. They're most worthwhile when you also practice attentively and reasonably consistently between lessons, so the feedback has something to build on." },
